WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.053 --> 00:00:02.089
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:14.315
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I like the multiculturalism. People from all over the world live in the UK and they live together happily. Usually.

3
00:00:16.232 --> 00:00:17.216
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

4
00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:22.656
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> For me it’s the language. English is international.

5
00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:29.580
I speak English. You speak English. I’m lucky – I don’t have communication problems.

6
00:00:31.739 --> 00:00:32.861
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

7
00:00:33.828 --> 00:00:41.754
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> I like the gardens. I have a small one, but I have flowers and vegetables in it.

8
00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:47.211
When the sun’s out, I sit there and I feel really happy.

9
00:00:49.093 --> 00:00:50.302
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

10
00:00:51.183 --> 00:00:57.330
<v><b>Speaker 4:</b></v> I love the freedom. I wear what I want. I say what I want. I do what I want.

11
00:00:59.247 --> 00:01:00.439
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

12
00:01:01.423 --> 00:01:09.712
<v><b>Speaker 5:</b></v> One thing I really like is the BBC. I listen to the radio in the morning and I watch TV in the evening.

13
00:01:10.074 --> 00:01:16.394
A lot of programmes are interesting, funny, or educational. Sometimes all three.

14
00:01:18.587 --> 00:01:19.744
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

15
00:01:20.677 --> 00:01:27.809
<v><b>Speaker 6:</b></v> I like the pubs. We drink there, and we eat there, too – the food now is very good.

16
00:01:29.397 --> 00:01:30.468
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

17
00:01:30.951 --> 00:01:36.304
<v><b>Speaker 7:</b></v> I really like the weather here. It’s cold, but not very cold.

18
00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:42.694
It’s hot, but not very hot. It rains, but it doesn’t rain every day.

19
00:01:44.645 --> 00:01:45.577
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

20
00:01:46.165 --> 00:01:51.967
<v><b>Speaker 8:</b></v> I love the Indian food. My boyfriend cooks fantastic curries,

21
00:01:52.001 --> 00:01:55.748
and the UK is great for Indian restaurants!